                        "form": "milléniums"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d05ffaef-11d9-3b21-9620-a4bdd902d1d1",
                        "entry_id": "7de40fd4-6da1-3da1-9697-44047a952b5c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Règne terrestre du Messie avant le jugement dernier, d'une durée de mille ans, époque rêvée par les millénaires, millénaristes ou chiliastes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d18a190-3e15-44f4-a143-9ebf6c2c1eee",
                                "sense_id": "d05ffaef-11d9-3b21-9620-a4bdd902d1d1",
                                "text": "Les fidèles de l'aurore du millénium pour qui le Christ, déjà réincarné, vit parmi nous, à notre insu."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "05295dc1-9753-3e7c-9cc4-254b597825bc",
                        "entry_id": "7de40fd4-6da1-3da1-9697-44047a952b5c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Longue période de paix et de bonheur sur terre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd673ac4-cc5a-4105-a0dd-f9aaf50689e4",
                                "sense_id": "05295dc1-9753-3e7c-9cc4-254b597825bc",
                                "text": "Depuis Baboeuf jusqu'à Saint-Simon et Fourier, depuis Proudhon, Louis Blanc et Cabet jusqu'à l'Internationale, plusieurs sortes de milléniums ont été construits sur le papier, et nous savons quels ravages ils font dans des cerveaux incultes conduits par des cerveaux demi-cultivés."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "44c24a72-7df0-4f61-afc8-e9e6e5cb4074",
                        "source_entry_id": "7de40fd4-6da1-3da1-9697-44047a952b5c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Millenium",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5078e362-98bf-441e-97af-c945efc8ee9c",
                        "source_entry_id": "7de40fd4-6da1-3da1-9697-44047a952b5c",
                        "target_lang_word": "millenium",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "millenium",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be81d4a3-7bff-30ef-8c46-066d0fe33568",
                                        "entry_id": "0d797b4d-a8f1-3184-8896-d7430ed4aa13",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Archaic spelling of millennium."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a754ad9-5dd5-41de-a9ff-9486e62b1152",
                                                "sense_id": "be81d4a3-7bff-30ef-8c46-066d0fe33568",
                                                "text": "But I think that this interval will be 1260 years: 1st, 1000 years of the millenium; 20, 260 years, the times of Gog and Magog; and the great assize, or judgment of the world, the sum of which is 1260 years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e445cc61-0d2b-4344-80ee-b52dbfc801e3",
                                                "sense_id": "be81d4a3-7bff-30ef-8c46-066d0fe33568",
                                                "text": "millenium, 1000 years: annuity, yearly income: annuitant; anniversary, the return of any particular day in the year; superannuated, disqualified by age. Septennial parliaments. A perennial plant. The Millenium was expected."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ef5f3b5-d882-4ced-86f8-aa1f32ea9564",
                                                "sense_id": "be81d4a3-7bff-30ef-8c46-066d0fe33568",
                                                "text": "Thus in the case of the 1,000 years, or the millenium, as it is commonly called, Mr. LORD is not only chargeable with this fallacy, but he makes it worse by mingling the two kinds of numbers together, in one arbitrary product."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8da1502-ec86-33ca-baa9-f1672d3ee375",
                                        "entry_id": "0d797b4d-a8f1-3184-8896-d7430ed4aa13",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Misspelling of millennium."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
